# =============================================================================
# /etc/opendkim/SigningTable - DKIM signing selector map
#
# Format: *@<domain>  <selector>._domainkey.<domain>
#
# Wildcard (*@) matching requires SigningTable to be loaded with "refile:"
# prefix in opendkim.conf (not "file:"). Each domain maps to its "mail"
# selector entry in KeyTable.
# Anonymised: real domain names replaced with example.* placeholders.
# =============================================================================

*@example.org          mail._domainkey.example.org
*@example.fr           mail._domainkey.example.fr
*@example.net          mail._domainkey.example.net
*@example.eu           mail._domainkey.example.eu
*@example-shop.net     mail._domainkey.example-shop.net
*@example-commerce.fr  mail._domainkey.example-commerce.fr
*@example-commerce.com mail._domainkey.example-commerce.com
*@example-marine.net   mail._domainkey.example-marine.net
*@example.kr           mail._domainkey.example.kr
*@example.aero         mail._domainkey.example.aero
*@example.sarl         mail._domainkey.example.sarl
*@example.tours        mail._domainkey.example.tours
